Start a process in a workspace (dev server, Electron, etc.)

Usage: forkspace run [OPTIONS] <NAME> [-- <COMMAND>...]

Arguments:
  <NAME>        Name of the workspace
  [COMMAND]...  Command to run (e.g. npm run dev)

Options:
      --port <PORT>          Port the app listens on inside the workspace [default: 3000]
      --port-wait <SECONDS>  How long to wait for the app to listen before returning (0 to skip) [default: 10]
      --stop                 Stop the running process instead of starting one
  -h, --help                 Print help
